## AI Agent Reasoning

### Context
Implement issue #30 as the first extensible ticket-creation baseline.

### Decisions Made
- Anonymous creation is intentionally allowed for this baseline and documented in ADR 001 so authentication can be layered on later.
- Ticket persistence is isolated behind a repository interface so fields and storage behavior can evolve without coupling the HTTP route to PostgreSQL.
- Vite was aligned to version 8 because the plugin-react version on current main declares Vite 8 as its supported peer.

### Trade-offs
- The initial schema stays intentionally small while preserving clear extension points for future ticket fields and ownership.

